# Durability-checkpoint law (2026-07-27): git carries the KNOWLEDGE corpus —
# registries, apotheoses, laws, probes, workflows, harvest JSON — plus the
# load-bearing witnesses (owner-marked OM-1/OM-2, the first real-Safari witness).
# Bulk pixel corpora stay disk-durable; every cited shot's sha256 is recorded in
# the committed registry docs, so loss or tampering is detectable. Regenerable
# trees (node_modules, vendored published artifacts) are never committed.
node_modules/
vendor/
audit/visual/shots/
audit/components/**/*.png
audit/visual/safari-real/*.png
!audit/visual/safari-real/picker-safari26.4-light.png
# The repo-root .gitignore blanket-ignores *.png; re-include the owner-marked witnesses
!audit/visual/owner-marked/*.png
